resources.string:
With "Force Tamper Keyboard" enabled, text you type on the native keyboard will be automatically tampered by your rules and may be auto-sent.

Please confirm:
1. This feature is only for personal use on your own device, legal and compliant;
2. Once enabled, input in all apps may be rewritten automatically (chat, search, comments, etc.), use it with care;
3. It is forbidden for harassment, fraud, forgery, impersonation or other illegal purposes; all consequences are borne by the user;
4. Keep the accessibility service enabled; you can turn this switch off anytime to restore normal input.

Tapping "I understand and agree" means you have read and accepted the above.
